00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:31.231 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Je me levais le matin et j'avais

00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:32.766 size:53% position:73% line:53%
terriblement soif, mais une soif

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:34.301 size:53% position:73% line:53%
anormale que javavavais jamais

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:35.836 size:53% position:73% line:53%
