00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:48.015 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux symptômes que moi, j'ai."

00:00:46.647 --> 00:00:48.048 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Après les poumons, le coeur,

00:00:48.182 --> 00:00:53.153 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le cerveau et le foie,

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:55.189 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on constate maintenant que le

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:57.224 size:53% position:73% line:53%
