00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:42.669 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le diabète, mais ce qui est déjà

00:01:38.699 --> 00:01:44.705 size:53% position:73% line:53%
établi, probablement à ce

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:46.707 size:53% position:73% line:53%
