00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:50.837 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Cependant, malgré ses nombreux

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:52.372 size:53% position:73% line:53%
problèmeelelelelelelelle ne

00:02:49.403 --> 00:02:53.907 size:53% position:73% line:53%
